Paws and Pivots (WORK IN PROGRESS)

This is a mini pixel game for row reducing for linear algebra!

## Features
- Solve matrices by reducing them to RREF
- Earn coins for correct solutions
- Customize your pet with outfits and accessories
- Increasing difficulty levels
- Intense mode where there is a timer

## Built With
- Python (Pycharm)
- Pygame

## What We Learned
- Implementing matrix operations programmatically
- Game state management in Pygame
- Combining math concepts with game design

